OL,3,GNEWSABoy sentenced for stabbing girl
OL,4,Awho would not date him
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe boy, from Wiltshire, admitted at
OL,7,FGloucester Crown Court wounding with
OL,8,Fintent, inflicting grievous bodily harm
OL,9,Fwithout intent and possession of a
OL,10,Fbladed article in a public place. He
OL,11,Fwas also handed a one-year referral
OL,12,Forder.
OL,14,FDet Supt Ian Fletcher said of CCTV of
OL,15,Fthe attack: "Anyone who sees footage
OL,16,Fwould say she is very lucky to not have
OL,17,Fvery serious, if not fatal injuries."
